"""
================================================================================
MASTER CLOCK = (VIDEO trimmed by TRIM_START_SEC) == (FIBER trimmed by TRIM_START_SEC)
MedPC is corrected INTO this master clock via MV DP monotonic matching.
INCREASE-only peri-event on fiber, VFR-safe clip writing on video.
================================================================================

CORE RULES
----------
- We intentionally discard the first TRIM_START_SEC seconds from BOTH fiber and video.
- After trimming, both timelines are re-zeroed so master t=0 starts at TRIM_START_SEC.
- Manual nosepoke timestamps are taken from the ORIGINAL video timeline -> we subtract TRIM_START_SEC.
- MV alignment estimates: t_master = a_mv * t_medpc + b_mv  (master is trimmed video timeline)
- NO MedPC->Fiber warping. Fiber is already in master time by construction (trim+re-zero).
"""

